[Music]  great news for all fans of massive  action  the hollywood reporter claims that  legendary is currently in the planning  stages for another monstroverse movie  with the ass of yet  unofficially confirmed name son of kong  this comes as a surprise to fans and  journalists alike  as following the decent success of  godzilla 2 king of monsters the studio  had actually decided to call it quits  after the release of godzilla vs kong  now however they are said to be in the  midst of talks with director adam  weingart for the purpose of the sequel  to the film universe  the 30 year old who recently directed  godzilla vs kong would be the first ever  to bring two films of the franchise to  the big screen  it would certainly be well worth it as  legendary's latest blockbuster achieved  the best box office results since the  beginning of the pandemic  with more than 400 million us dollars  and that despite the fact that the movie  theaters are not even  open in many countries in case of doubt  though you will have to be ready for a  somewhat longer wait with wingate since  the u.s american  is quite busy at the moment with his  thundercats film as well as a sequel  to face off work on the upcoming mcu  spectacle guardians of the galaxy 3 is  in full swing yet james gunn did miss  the chance to hit at a small special for  fans on twitter  so far only the title the guardians of  the galaxy holiday special is known and  the 50 year old director has not yet  commented on the plot  based on the emojis and theme it is of  course clear that it must be a christmas  special which is set to release  next year the news didn't just trigger  jumps of joy however as star wars legend  mark hamlet commented on twitter with a  wink that he had a bad  feeling about the special die-hard star  wars fans are of course aware of what he  means as the 69  year old hamill starred in the now  notorious star wars holiday special from  1978  notorious for being so bad that it was  cancelled after a short time  and internally scrapped george lucas  also deemed the production atrocious and  is probably glad that the holiday  special  is hard to find these days and is even  considered a collectible among fans  regardless we're looking forward to  james gunn's hopefully totally awesome  guardians of the galaxy christmas  special  warning to all the falcon and the winter  soldier viewers if you haven't finished  watching the series finale yet it's best  to skip this news  everyone else can rejoice because disney  has recently published a poster with the  new captain america  just in time for the finale of the  mansion disney plus series sam wilson  alias  falcon gets his new cap suit from the  kingdom of wakanda  in parallel it has also been leaked that  marvel is already working on captain  america 4.  behind the camera the falcon and the  winter soldier showrunner malcolm  spellman and writer dalain muzon will be  responsible for the script  while there is no information yet known  regarding the cast  needless to say anthony mackie and  sebastian stan should be given their  respective roles  but we would also be excited to see  chris evans make an appearance for  example  equally pleasing would be a reappearance  of daniel bruhl since he pretty much  delighted the fans with his role as  baron zemo  anthony mackie definitely can't wait to  play the new cap  for as he revealed to entertainment  weekly on tuesday the clueless 42 year  old is believed to have learned about  marvel's movie plans in a supermarket  we are definitely looking forward to new  information about captain america 4  and we'll of course keep you up to date  on our website and in the weekly news  as usual the production start of the  game of thrones spin-off house of the  dragon was officially heralded recently  just in time for the start of filming  there are also first pictures of the  cast and the set  in various shots we get to know the main  character renora targaryen played by  amadarsi and king viserys the first  played by patty considine  also in the cast are matt smith as  prince damon targaryen  olivia cook as ellison hightower steve  tussand asked the sea serpent  and ray sivans as otto hightower it's a  bit of a pity that you can't see the  actors in full costume in the pictures  which is why we're all the more pleased  to see more shots from the british  tabloid newspaper daily mail  here for example we can take a rather  unofficial look at the two series rivals  matt smith and emma darcy this brings us  to the next topic  the story as in the original series you  can look forward to elaborate intrigues  and the bloody race for the throne  in house of the dragon the focus is on  the two siblings renera and damon who  would both like to take over the throne  of their father viserys  so expect great entertainment from hbo  but house of the dragon is not likely to  premiere on hbo max before  2022 fans of the netflix hit money heist  are eagerly awaiting the release of  season 5.  so far a common thread running through  the series has been that the cast is  continually growing this is also the  case for the new season where fans can  welcome at least four new stars in  addition to the majority of the cast  from season four  joining them are miguel angel silvestri  patrick creato alberto amarilla and jose  manel  sadly these specific roles of the  newcomers are still secret so we will  have to be patient for more details  should season 5 really be released this  year as designed by fans we can  certainly expect  new information soon  the annual academy awards were handed  out to hollywood stars and starlets this  past  sunday it was already obvious in advance  that the pandemic and the selection of  films meant that the viewing figures  were not really going to be great  however even the harshest critic would  have been surprised by  how poor the ratings for the award  ceremony really were  according to the us broadcaster nbc a  mere 9.85 million viewers watched this  year's significantly cut program  which is even less than half of the  previous negative record set in  2020 but now for the exciting part  the winners the critically priced road  movie nomad land by chloe zhao won  in three categories best picture best  director  and with francis mcdormand also in the  best actress category  the highlight at the end was certainly  the surprising award of an oscar to the  83 year old sir anthony hopkins who was  nominated in the best actor in a leading  role category and came out  on top almost ironically hopkins was not  even on site was not aware of the award  ceremony and then only expressed his  thoughts on monday morning via instagram  in a statement he announced that at 83  years old he had not expected to receive  the award and at the same time he paid  tribute to the late chadwick boseman  with a few kind words  this is apt after all just about  everyone had expected another posthumous  award for the black panther actor  as the first asian and second woman ever  record breaking director chloe xiao  accepted the oscar for best director  not an undeserved award since zhao's no  midland is one of the few glimmers of  hope in an otherwise  film poor era other winners were pixar's  soul in best animated feature film  another round in best international  feature film daniel  kaluya in best supporting actor and yoon  young in best supporting actress  did you watch the oscars and if so what  are your thoughts on the winners and the  ceremony itself  let us know in the comments see you next  time  [Music]  you

